{"id": "19-2052-2-7", "zh": "5,22. 在 tud 等词根之后加 ka", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2053-2-7", "zh": "在 tud 等词根之后，表示主动、属于 la 类词尾的场合，要加 ka。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2053-8-12", "zh": "例如 tudati、tudanti 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2053-13-23", "zh": "表被动时：tudyati、tujjati，tudyare、tudyanti，tujjare、tujjanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2053-24-27", "zh": "同样还有 tudissati、tujjissati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-2053-28-33", "zh": "atudi、atudiṃsu、atujji。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2053-34-39", "zh": "atudissa、atujjissa，tudeyya、tujjeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2053-40-46", "zh": "tudatu、tudantu、tujjatu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2054-2-7", "zh": "visa 表示“进入”，前面加 pa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2054-8-12", "zh": "例如“他进入村庄”（so gāmaṃ pavisati）等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-2054-13-15", "zh": "表被动时：pavisīyati 等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-2054-16-17", "zh": "pavisissati。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2054-18-19", "zh": "pavisīyissati。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2054-20-31", "zh": "pāvisi；在词尾 ī 之前，依据“bhujamucā”等规则的拆分适用（yogavibhāga），得到 kkhaṅa。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-2054-32-40", "zh": "pāvisi、pavisi、pāvekkhi；“他们进入了大地”（pathaviṃ pāvisiṃsu、pavisiṃsu）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2054-41-42", "zh": "pāvisīyi。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2054-43-45", "zh": "pāvisissa、pavisissa。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2054-46-47", "zh": "pāvisīyissa。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2054-48-54", "zh": "pavise、paviseyya，前者省去了中间词缀（vikaraṇa）；被动为 pavisīyeyya。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2054-55-59", "zh": "pavisatu、pavisīyatu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2054-60-61", "zh": "nudati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2054-62-76", "zh": "disa 表示“说出”，如 uddissati；另有 likhati、tusati 等。（以上是 tud 类词根的变化方式。）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2055-2-5", "zh": "ji 表示“战胜”，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2056-2-7", "zh": "5,23. 在 ji 等词根之后加 knā", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2057-2-7", "zh": "在 ji 等词根之后，表示主动、属于 la 类词尾的场合，要加 knā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2057-8-10", "zh": "不作元音强化（vuddhi）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2057-11-15", "zh": "例如“战胜烦恼”：jināti、jinanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "19-2057-16-24", "zh": "被动如“烦恼被他战胜”：jīyati、jīyanti，在 kya 之前元音变长。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "19-2057-25-28", "zh": "jinissati、jinissanti。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-29-31", "zh": "ajini、jini。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-32-35", "zh": "ajīyi、ajīyittha。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-36-37", "zh": "ajinissa。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-38-39", "zh": "ajīyissa。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-40-41", "zh": "jineyya。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-42-44", "zh": "jinātu 等。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2057-45-54", "zh": "ci 表示“积聚”，同样有 cināti、cinanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2058-2-5", "zh": "ñā 表示“了知”，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2059-2-8", "zh": "5,120. ñā 在 na 之前变为 jā", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2060-2-6", "zh": "词根 ñā 在 na 音之前变为 jā。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "19-2060-7-8", "zh": "vijānāti。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2061-2-7", "zh": "61. 带 nā 的 ñā 在 ti 之前变为 nāya", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2062-2-8", "zh": "带 nā 的词根 ñā，在 ti 之前可以变为 nāya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2062-9-13", "zh": "nāyati、vijānāti 等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-2062-14-16", "zh": "表被动时：viññāyati 等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-2062-17-43", "zh": "在 kya 之前，依据“āsse cā”这条规则里“āsse”一语的拆分适用，ā 变为 e，再把 ya 重叠，得到 ñeyyati、ñeyyanti 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2062-44-47", "zh": "vijānissati、vijānissanti。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2062-48-49", "zh": "表被动时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2062-50-68", "zh": "依据“kyassa sse”规则省去 kya，并把元音变短，得到 ñāssati、ñāssanti；另有 viññāyissati、paññāyissati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2063-2-6", "zh": "65. 被动时 ssa 变为 hi", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2064-2-13", "zh": "在 ñā 之后的 ssa，表被动时可以变为 hi，如 paññāyihiti、paññāyihinti。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "19-2064-14-20", "zh": "加入增音 a 时为 samajāni；另有 saṃjāni、saṃjāniṃsu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2064-21-24", "zh": "samajāniṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2064-25-28", "zh": "表被动时：paññāyi、paññāyiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2064-29-30", "zh": "ajānissa。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2064-31-32", "zh": "表被动时：aññāyissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2065-2-7", "zh": "63. eyya 可以变为 iyā 和 ñā", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "19-2066-2-10", "zh": "在 ñā 之后的 eyya，可以变为 iyā 和 ñā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "19-2066-11-12", "zh": "jāniyā。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2067-2-5", "zh": "62. 在 ñā 之前变为 jaṃ", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2068-2-8", "zh": "在替换形 ñā 之前，带 nā 的词根 ñā 可以变为 jaṃ。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2068-9-14", "zh": "jaññā、jāneyya、jāneyyuṃ。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2068-15-18", "zh": "表被动时：paññāyeyya、paññāyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2068-19-22", "zh": "vijānātu、vijānanthu。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "19-2068-23-25", "zh": "表被动时：viññāyatu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2069-2-23", "zh": "mā 表示“度量”；依据“ā ī ssādīnaṃ byañjanassiña”这条规则里“iña”一语的拆分适用，加入增音 i 后省去前面的元音，得到 mināti、minanti。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2069-24-26", "zh": "表被动时：mīyati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2069-27-44", "zh": "lū 表示“割”；依据“kṇāknāsu rasso”规则，词根元音变短，得到 lunāti、lunanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2069-45-47", "zh": "表被动时：lūyati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2069-48-58", "zh": "dhu 表示“摇动”，如 dhunāti 等。（以上是 ji 类词根的变化方式。）", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "19-2070-2-5", "zh": "kī 表示“交换财物”，", "confidence": 75}
